- Rename CONTENIDOS to Canvas or Profield NM titles.  
- Publish unresolved Ahmes metadata.  
- Call Thessia for slideshow sentences.  
- Invent ECTS/weights (already closed in CV).  
- Invent **quotes** or citations in lessons (Ahmes-only extracts).  
